{"id":"volya","lemma":"воля","pos":"noun","rank":2235,"glosses":["will, willpower","power","freedom"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6c/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"воли","plural":"воли"},"examples":[{"text":"Где есть воля, там есть путь.","en":"Where there's a will, there's a way.","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null,{"g":"there"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},{"g":"way, path, road"}]},{"text":"Я сделал работу против моей воли.","en":"I did the work against my will.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},null,{"g":"against"},{"g":"my, mine","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Я сделала это против своей воли.","en":"I did it against my will.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Это вопрос силы воли.","en":"It's a question of will power.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"question"},{"g":"strength","l":"сила"},null]},{"text":"Воля ваша.","en":"Suit yourself.","words":[null,{"g":"your, yours","l":"ваш"}]}]}